{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は嬉しいことが！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は昨日で終了するはずだった\n渋谷TSUTAYAさんでの写真集発売記念パネルの展示期間が一週間延長になったこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/14/0153750/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！！こんな有難いことないよ！\n20日まで展示されているので、用事あって行けなかった～。という方！\nまだ間に合うので是非行ってみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装展示は初の試みなんだって！\nXXSsizeのTシャツを是非...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、撮影に持っていった一眼のデータ\n折角なので載せてみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/14/0153750/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/14/0153750/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/14/0153750/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2017/03/14/0153750/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだあるよー\nまた次回。。。\nパワー！"}],"source":"archive"}